// The editor as a function from a web `Request` to a `Response`, with its host client, clock and
// secret passed in, so it runs the same under src/server.ts and under a test with a fake `fetch`.
//
// Every request is authenticated here: a signed session cookie, then the host's membership list
// (auth/membership.ts). A visitor with neither is sent to the site's login page; nothing in the
// domain is read or changed before that. Posts must come from this site (the cookie is SameSite=Lax
// and the Origin header is checked too).
